---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../../consts";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`About — ${SITE.author}`}
  description="Backend engineer turned AI builder. I worked on search and data in commerce and logistics; these days I build AI products and work on AEO."
  locale="en"
  path="/about/"
  ogType="profile"
>
  <div class="prose prose-zinc max-w-none dark:prose-invert prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-a:text-accent">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>I built backend systems in commerce and logistics. Now I build AI.</p>

    <h2>Backend</h2>
    <p>
      I started at FinTalk, a fintech startup. Then I spent five-plus years at WeMakePrice on its
      commerce platform — building search that pulled the lowest-price product from catalogs, and
      running crawler pipelines that collected thousands of records a day. During real-time
      search-keyword events, I handled tens of thousands of concurrent users.
    </p>
    <p>
      At Hanexpress I designed the shared modules and architecture for logistics solutions
      (WMS/FMS) and built an AWS EKS microservices platform — from code to infra.
    </p>

    <h2>AI</h2>
    <p>
      Watching LLMs change search pulled me in. I finished AIFFEL's AI research track, studied NLP,
      and built a RAG-based Q&amp;A system.
    </p>
    <p>
      These days I work on AEO (Answer Engine Optimization) — measuring and improving how AIs like
      ChatGPT and Perplexity talk about a brand. I build pipelines that query several models at once
      and apply them to real clients in hospitality and construction.
    </p>
    <p>The search-and-data work from commerce led straight here.</p>

    <h2>What's next</h2>
    <p>I want to design AI systems from the ground up.</p>
    <p>
      <a href="/en/resume/">Resume</a> · <a href="/en/work/">Work</a> ·
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>Email</a> · <a href={SITE.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
